; Test whether the current actor can reach an object
;
; Runs #R$9E40 with IX set to the actor record at (#R$B70C); IX is kept.
;
; A Object id
; IY Record of the object
; O:F NZ when the object is within reach of the actor
@label=ActorCanReach
c$9E34 PUSH IX
 $9E36 LD IX,($B70C)
 $9E3A CALL $9E40
 $9E3D POP IX
 $9E3F RET
